Z||000009||kslish||11-29-2000||06:51 PM||||I'm from Pittsburgh (one of the Fiero owners FieroLisa is referring to)....more specifically I live east of the city in the Crafton/Ingram area down Rt. 60 coming from the Airport.  I certainly know where Bethel Park is.  <P>I'm the Secretary/Webmaster/Historian (and some other things like being the newsletter editor) for the Western PA Fiero Club.  You can check out our web page at:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>http://www.westpennfiero.org</A> <P>The WPFC is now at almost 50 members, and your invited to join us (a printable application is on the web page).  Or if you prefer to check us out first, our next club event is our post-Holiday party/get-together in mid-January.  E-mail me if you would want to attend.  New faces are always welcome, and this goes for the everyone else that has posted on this thread.  I don't believe we have any members yet from WV and just one from Ohio.  <P>Ken S.<BR>'86 Coupe and '87 GT <BR>(and a '88 Formula and another '86 Coupe that are really my dad's but I do most of the work on them)||||reg||10
